12
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:21,670
What were the challenges there?

13
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:26,070
Yeah, I mean, so at Joyant and so Joint was a cloud computing pioneer.

14
00:01:26,070 --> 00:01:32,469
We competed with the likes of AWS and then later GCP and

