00:01:32,469 --> 00:01:41,270
Azure and we I mean we were operating at a scale right we had a bunch of machines a bunch of DCs but ultimately you know we were a VCbacked company and

16
00:01:41,270 --> 00:01:48,870
you know a small company by the standards of certainly by Samsung standards and so when Samsung bought the company and

17
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:57,990
the reason by the way that Samsung bought Joy is Samsung's cloud bill was let's just say it was extremely March,

