00:03:38,309 --> 00:03:48,229
And we had I mean, it should be said we had great software and great software expertise and we were controlling our own system software,

35
00:03:48,229 --> 00:03:56,790
but even controlling your own system software, your own host OS, your own control plane, which is what we had at Joyand, ultimately you're pretty limited. you go.

